Give the save screens a hundred pages of ten slots

As Fallout 2 CE has: the arrows left and right turn a page, ten pages
with SHIFT, as do "<< BACK" and "MORE >>" under the list, in the
Pip-Boy's own words; up and down go on into the next page. A page's
slots are read when it is first shown. Loading a save at start-up,
and saving into the slot the page asks for, take any of the thousand.
